## 14. Implementation Risk Assessment

### High Risk
- [ ] **CSS Color Module L5** — Requires fallback for Firefox
- [ ] **Complex Animations** — May need throttle/optimization
- [ ] **Theme System** — Section-level themes add complexity
- [ ] **Accessibility** — Missing focus indicators

### Medium Risk
- [ ] **CSS Layers** — New architecture, learning curve
- [ ] **Z-Index Management** — Needs systematic scale
- [ ] **Token Compliance** — Hardcoded values scattered

### Low Risk
- [ ] **Typography** — Standard web fonts
- [ ] **Layout** — Flexbox/Grid well-supported

